[
  {
    "start": "00:00:08.630",
    "end": "00:00:11.383",
    "start_seconds": 8.63,
    "end_seconds": 11.383,
    "text": "When I was eight years old, I had this ritual."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:11.883",
    "end": "00:00:15.470",
    "start_seconds": 11.883,
    "end_seconds": 15.47,
    "text": "After I finished my homework, I'd head upstairs to my room,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:15.512",
    "end": "00:00:18.265",
    "start_seconds": 15.512,
    "end_seconds": 18.265,
    "text": "turn on my favorite Christina Aguilera CD,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:18.265",
    "end": "00:00:19.850",
    "start_seconds": 18.265,
    "end_seconds": 19.85,
    "text": "and sit on the floor"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:19.891",
    "end": "00:00:23.812",
    "start_seconds": 19.891,
    "end_seconds": 23.812,
    "text": "surrounding myself with all this stuff that was supposed to make me playful."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:24.145",
    "end": "00:00:26.690",
    "start_seconds": 24.145,
    "end_seconds": 26.69,
    "text": "I'd take out my Barbies one by one,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.690",
    "end": "00:00:29.734",
    "start_seconds": 26.69,
    "end_seconds": 29.734,
    "text": "spread out my markers in every color,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.776",
    "end": "00:00:31.069",
    "start_seconds": 29.776,
    "end_seconds": 31.069,
    "text": "and then I'd wait."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:32.487",
    "end": "00:00:33.780",
    "start_seconds": 32.487,
    "end_seconds": 33.78,
    "text": "And I'd wait."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:34.739",
    "end": "00:00:38.827",
    "start_seconds": 34.739,
    "end_seconds": 38.827,
    "text": "And I'd wait until something felt worthy enough,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:38.869",
    "end": "00:00:40.829",
    "start_seconds": 38.869,
    "end_seconds": 40.829,
    "text": "perfect enough to make."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:41.413",
    "end": "00:00:44.040",
    "start_seconds": 41.413,
    "end_seconds": 44.04,
    "text": "That moment barely ever came."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.624",
    "end": "00:00:46.084",
    "start_seconds": 44.624,
    "end_seconds": 46.084,
    "text": "Ever since I was a kid,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.084",
    "end": "00:00:49.045",
    "start_seconds": 46.084,
    "end_seconds": 49.045,
    "text": "play felt like something that I had to earn."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49.045",
    "end": "00:00:52.382",
    "start_seconds": 49.045,
    "end_seconds": 52.382,
    "text": "And when I finally did do it, I took it seriously."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.841",
    "end": "00:00:56.761",
    "start_seconds": 52.841,
    "end_seconds": 56.761,
    "text": "My favorite game growing up was emergency-room doctor."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:56.803",
    "end": "00:01:00.015",
    "start_seconds": 56.803,
    "end_seconds": 60.015,
    "text": "I’d force my younger brother to scrub in, robes on,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:00.015",
    "end": "00:01:02.142",
    "start_seconds": 60.015,
    "end_seconds": 62.142,
    "text": "Beanie Babies fully prepped,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.183",
    "end": "00:01:04.019",
    "start_seconds": 62.183,
    "end_seconds": 64.019,
    "text": "and I was head surgeon, of course,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.060",
    "end": "00:01:07.105",
    "start_seconds": 64.06,
    "end_seconds": 67.105,
    "text": "so there was no room for mistakes in my OR."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:07.772",
    "end": "00:01:10.901",
    "start_seconds": 67.772,
    "end_seconds": 70.901,
    "text": "Most people don't become play skeptics"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.942",
    "end": "00:01:12.819",
    "start_seconds": 70.94200000000001,
    "end_seconds": 72.819,
    "text": "until they're adults."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:12.819",
    "end": "00:01:16.573",
    "start_seconds": 72.819,
    "end_seconds": 76.57300000000001,
    "text": "But for me, even at eight, I was questioning the point of it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:17.324",
    "end": "00:01:21.286",
    "start_seconds": 77.324,
    "end_seconds": 81.286,
    "text": "So I ended up doing what any reasonable skeptic would do,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:21.328",
    "end": "00:01:23.413",
    "start_seconds": 81.328,
    "end_seconds": 83.413,
    "text": "and I became a scientist."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.788",
    "end": "00:01:26.041",
    "start_seconds": 83.788,
    "end_seconds": 86.041,
    "text": "I got my master's in clinical psychology"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:26.082",
    "end": "00:01:30.003",
    "start_seconds": 86.082,
    "end_seconds": 90.003,
    "text": "and spent almost the last decade studying the science of creativity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:30.462",
    "end": "00:01:35.383",
    "start_seconds": 90.462,
    "end_seconds": 95.38300000000001,
    "text": "And what I discovered surprised me because creativity isn't just a talent."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:35.800",
    "end": "00:01:38.762",
    "start_seconds": 95.8,
    "end_seconds": 98.762,
    "text": "It is a core part of all of our well-being,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:38.762",
    "end": "00:01:40.972",
    "start_seconds": 98.762,
    "end_seconds": 100.97200000000001,
    "text": "a pillar that I came to establish"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.972",
    "end": "00:01:44.559",
    "start_seconds": 100.97200000000001,
    "end_seconds": 104.559,
    "text": "and become a fierce advocate for, called “creative health.”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:45.060",
    "end": "00:01:46.561",
    "start_seconds": 105.06,
    "end_seconds": 106.561,
    "text": "And one of the best strategies"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:46.603",
    "end": "00:01:48.939",
    "start_seconds": 106.60300000000001,
    "end_seconds": 108.939,
    "text": "that we have to strengthen our creative health"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:48.980",
    "end": "00:01:52.734",
    "start_seconds": 108.97999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 112.73400000000001,
    "text": "is exactly what I dismissed as a kid: play."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:53.193",
    "end": "00:01:56.071",
    "start_seconds": 113.193,
    "end_seconds": 116.071,
    "text": "That's because when we play, especially as adults,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:56.112",
    "end": "00:01:59.157",
    "start_seconds": 116.112,
    "end_seconds": 119.157,
    "text": "we unlock this unique type of flourishing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:59.491",
    "end": "00:02:02.369",
    "start_seconds": 119.491,
    "end_seconds": 122.369,
    "text": "We have deeper fulfillment and stronger resilience"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:02.369",
    "end": "00:02:04.955",
    "start_seconds": 122.369,
    "end_seconds": 124.955,
    "text": "and even more original ideas."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:05.455",
    "end": "00:02:07.499",
    "start_seconds": 125.455,
    "end_seconds": 127.499,
    "text": "But the type of play that I'm talking about"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:07.499",
    "end": "00:02:10.210",
    "start_seconds": 127.499,
    "end_seconds": 130.21,
    "text": "is probably not what we're all imagining."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.251",
    "end": "00:02:15.298",
    "start_seconds": 130.251,
    "end_seconds": 135.298,
    "text": "It's not just being silly or childlike, or even starting up a brand new hobby."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:15.340",
    "end": "00:02:17.968",
    "start_seconds": 135.34,
    "end_seconds": 137.968,
    "text": "We’ve reduced play to be this cherry on top"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.009",
    "end": "00:02:19.719",
    "start_seconds": 138.00900000000001,
    "end_seconds": 139.719,
    "text": "of an already good life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:19.761",
    "end": "00:02:23.848",
    "start_seconds": 139.761,
    "end_seconds": 143.848,
    "text": "But from a scientific perspective, it is much more fundamental than that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:24.641",
    "end": "00:02:28.561",
    "start_seconds": 144.641,
    "end_seconds": 148.561,
    "text": "Play is what happens anytime we choose to do something"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.603",
    "end": "00:02:31.147",
    "start_seconds": 148.603,
    "end_seconds": 151.147,
    "text": "without knowing exactly where it's going to end up."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.564",
    "end": "00:02:33.566",
    "start_seconds": 151.564,
    "end_seconds": 153.566,
    "text": "There are no instructions we need to follow"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:33.566",
    "end": "00:02:35.443",
    "start_seconds": 153.566,
    "end_seconds": 155.44299999999998,
    "text": "or outcomes we need to achieve."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.485",
    "end": "00:02:37.028",
    "start_seconds": 155.485,
    "end_seconds": 157.028,
    "text": "Just two elements:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:37.028",
    "end": "00:02:39.864",
    "start_seconds": 157.028,
    "end_seconds": 159.864,
    "text": "intrinsic motivation and the freedom"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.864",
    "end": "00:02:42.450",
    "start_seconds": 159.864,
    "end_seconds": 162.45,
    "text": "not to know the answer in advance."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:42.951",
    "end": "00:02:46.162",
    "start_seconds": 162.951,
    "end_seconds": 166.162,
    "text": "The problem is, we've come to treat that type of play"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:46.204",
    "end": "00:02:48.123",
    "start_seconds": 166.204,
    "end_seconds": 168.123,
    "text": "as worse than optional."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.123",
    "end": "00:02:50.834",
    "start_seconds": 168.123,
    "end_seconds": 170.834,
    "text": "It's something that we avoid and even punish."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.209",
    "end": "00:02:55.839",
    "start_seconds": 171.209,
    "end_seconds": 175.839,
    "text": "So much so that upwards of 70 percent of adults around the world today"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:55.880",
    "end": "00:02:57.298",
    "start_seconds": 175.88,
    "end_seconds": 177.298,
    "text": "have stopped doing it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.924",
    "end": "00:02:59.300",
    "start_seconds": 177.924,
    "end_seconds": 179.3,
    "text": "I first noticed this pattern"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:59.342",
    "end": "00:03:01.469",
    "start_seconds": 179.34199999999998,
    "end_seconds": 181.469,
    "text": "as I was interviewing thousands of people"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:01.511",
    "end": "00:03:03.763",
    "start_seconds": 181.511,
    "end_seconds": 183.763,
    "text": "about their current relationship with play,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:03.805",
    "end": "00:03:06.766",
    "start_seconds": 183.805,
    "end_seconds": 186.766,
    "text": "and I kept hearing the same thing over and over."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:06.808",
    "end": "00:03:09.769",
    "start_seconds": 186.808,
    "end_seconds": 189.769,
    "text": "They told me they didn't have the time or the talent"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.769",
    "end": "00:03:12.022",
    "start_seconds": 189.769,
    "end_seconds": 192.022,
    "text": "or the right tools to do it anymore."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.063",
    "end": "00:03:15.483",
    "start_seconds": 192.063,
    "end_seconds": 195.483,
    "text": "And when they finally did, it wasn't play."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:15.525",
    "end": "00:03:17.861",
    "start_seconds": 195.525,
    "end_seconds": 197.861,
    "text": "It looked a lot like my emergency room,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:17.902",
    "end": "00:03:21.948",
    "start_seconds": 197.902,
    "end_seconds": 201.948,
    "text": "something that was scheduled and optimized with nothing left to chance."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:22.741",
    "end": "00:03:24.784",
    "start_seconds": 202.74099999999999,
    "end_seconds": 204.784,
    "text": "I know this might not seem like a big deal,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24.784",
    "end": "00:03:26.745",
    "start_seconds": 204.784,
    "end_seconds": 206.745,
    "text": "like, we're just having less fun."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:26.745",
    "end": "00:03:28.580",
    "start_seconds": 206.745,
    "end_seconds": 208.57999999999998,
    "text": "But it's deeper than that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.039",
    "end": "00:03:32.667",
    "start_seconds": 209.039,
    "end_seconds": 212.667,
    "text": "We are living through a “play-deprivation crisis.”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.001",
    "end": "00:03:37.088",
    "start_seconds": 213.001,
    "end_seconds": 217.088,
    "text": "We've systematically removed everything that makes play what it is."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.130",
    "end": "00:03:39.883",
    "start_seconds": 217.13,
    "end_seconds": 219.883,
    "text": "The spontaneity, the freedom, the wonder,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.924",
    "end": "00:03:41.676",
    "start_seconds": 219.924,
    "end_seconds": 221.676,
    "text": "from all parts of adult life"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.718",
    "end": "00:03:44.679",
    "start_seconds": 221.71800000000002,
    "end_seconds": 224.679,
    "text": "and replaced it with efficiency and achievement."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:45.055",
    "end": "00:03:47.891",
    "start_seconds": 225.055,
    "end_seconds": 227.891,
    "text": "And in doing so, we're losing the very survival skills"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:47.932",
    "end": "00:03:49.642",
    "start_seconds": 227.93200000000002,
    "end_seconds": 229.642,
    "text": "that we need the most right now."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:49.684",
    "end": "00:03:54.355",
    "start_seconds": 229.684,
    "end_seconds": 234.355,
    "text": "Things like our capacity to adapt and imagine and even feel alive."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.190",
    "end": "00:03:56.900",
    "start_seconds": 235.19,
    "end_seconds": 236.9,
    "text": "Play deprivation is tricky, though,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.900",
    "end": "00:03:59.694",
    "start_seconds": 236.9,
    "end_seconds": 239.69400000000002,
    "text": "because at first we barely notice it's happening."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.694",
    "end": "00:04:01.654",
    "start_seconds": 239.69400000000002,
    "end_seconds": 241.654,
    "text": "We just feel endlessly busy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.030",
    "end": "00:04:03.823",
    "start_seconds": 242.03,
    "end_seconds": 243.823,
    "text": "But over time, without play,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:03.865",
    "end": "00:04:07.535",
    "start_seconds": 243.865,
    "end_seconds": 247.535,
    "text": "stress can compound and then burnout can become chronic."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:07.827",
    "end": "00:04:10.205",
    "start_seconds": 247.827,
    "end_seconds": 250.205,
    "text": "And then we walk around as playless adults,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.246",
    "end": "00:04:13.583",
    "start_seconds": 250.246,
    "end_seconds": 253.583,
    "text": "which ultimately creates a playless society,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:13.625",
    "end": "00:04:16.461",
    "start_seconds": 253.625,
    "end_seconds": 256.461,
    "text": "one where our institutions can grow rigid"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:16.503",
    "end": "00:04:18.630",
    "start_seconds": 256.503,
    "end_seconds": 258.63,
    "text": "and lonely and polarized."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.089",
    "end": "00:04:21.257",
    "start_seconds": 259.089,
    "end_seconds": 261.257,
    "text": "But we can change this, though."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.299",
    "end": "00:04:25.178",
    "start_seconds": 261.299,
    "end_seconds": 265.178,
    "text": "Not even just for ourselves, but for future generations too."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:25.178",
    "end": "00:04:28.139",
    "start_seconds": 265.178,
    "end_seconds": 268.139,
    "text": "Because play isn't something we age out of."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.181",
    "end": "00:04:30.016",
    "start_seconds": 268.181,
    "end_seconds": 270.016,
    "text": "It is a lifelong trait,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.058",
    "end": "00:04:33.144",
    "start_seconds": 270.058,
    "end_seconds": 273.144,
    "text": "which means no matter how invisible it might feel,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.144",
    "end": "00:04:35.563",
    "start_seconds": 273.144,
    "end_seconds": 275.563,
    "text": "we can always restore it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:35.563",
    "end": "00:04:38.399",
    "start_seconds": 275.563,
    "end_seconds": 278.399,
    "text": "And how we go about doing that is much simpler"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.441",
    "end": "00:04:40.235",
    "start_seconds": 278.44100000000003,
    "end_seconds": 280.235,
    "text": "and more expansive than you'd think."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:41.236",
    "end": "00:04:42.612",
    "start_seconds": 281.236,
    "end_seconds": 282.612,
    "text": "At my company Daydreamers,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:42.612",
    "end": "00:04:45.532",
    "start_seconds": 282.612,
    "end_seconds": 285.532,
    "text": "one of the things we got extremely curious to figure out"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:45.573",
    "end": "00:04:48.159",
    "start_seconds": 285.573,
    "end_seconds": 288.159,
    "text": "was finding the optimal way to play."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:48.493",
    "end": "00:04:50.662",
    "start_seconds": 288.493,
    "end_seconds": 290.662,
    "text": "Are you noticing a trend about me yet?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.662",
    "end": "00:04:54.332",
    "start_seconds": 290.662,
    "end_seconds": 294.332,
    "text": "We studied all kinds of people, executives, postal workers,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.374",
    "end": "00:04:55.625",
    "start_seconds": 294.374,
    "end_seconds": 295.625,
    "text": "stay-at-home parents"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:55.625",
    "end": "00:04:57.669",
    "start_seconds": 295.625,
    "end_seconds": 297.669,
    "text": "from 18 to 85."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.669",
    "end": "00:05:00.213",
    "start_seconds": 297.669,
    "end_seconds": 300.213,
    "text": "And we looked at how they played not in a lab,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:00.213",
    "end": "00:05:02.382",
    "start_seconds": 300.213,
    "end_seconds": 302.382,
    "text": "but in the texture of their daily lives."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.757",
    "end": "00:05:06.469",
    "start_seconds": 302.757,
    "end_seconds": 306.469,
    "text": "And as we analyze the millions of minutes of creative behaviors"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:06.511",
    "end": "00:05:10.723",
    "start_seconds": 306.511,
    "end_seconds": 310.723,
    "text": "that we collected through pictures and psychologically validated assessments,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:10.765",
    "end": "00:05:13.184",
    "start_seconds": 310.765,
    "end_seconds": 313.184,
    "text": "we found the opposite of my hypothesis."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:13.643",
    "end": "00:05:17.647",
    "start_seconds": 313.64300000000003,
    "end_seconds": 317.647,
    "text": "Play wasn't some list of actions we could add to our calendar."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:17.689",
    "end": "00:05:19.399",
    "start_seconds": 317.689,
    "end_seconds": 319.399,
    "text": "It was an approach."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:19.816",
    "end": "00:05:23.862",
    "start_seconds": 319.816,
    "end_seconds": 323.862,
    "text": "The people who became creatively healthy were doing something differently."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:23.903",
    "end": "00:05:27.282",
    "start_seconds": 323.903,
    "end_seconds": 327.282,
    "text": "They were playing all the time in all these parts of life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:27.323",
    "end": "00:05:30.118",
    "start_seconds": 327.323,
    "end_seconds": 330.118,
    "text": "Thinking playfully, expressing themselves playfully,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:30.160",
    "end": "00:05:32.579",
    "start_seconds": 330.16,
    "end_seconds": 332.579,
    "text": "even noticing when it happened around them."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:32.579",
    "end": "00:05:37.000",
    "start_seconds": 332.579,
    "end_seconds": 337.0,
    "text": "And as they began to embody it, their lives transformed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:37.041",
    "end": "00:05:39.085",
    "start_seconds": 337.041,
    "end_seconds": 339.085,
    "text": "So while I wish I could stand here"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:39.085",
    "end": "00:05:42.839",
    "start_seconds": 339.085,
    "end_seconds": 342.839,
    "text": "and give us one play prescription to follow,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:42.839",
    "end": "00:05:45.216",
    "start_seconds": 342.839,
    "end_seconds": 345.216,
    "text": "that would be the antithesis of what it is."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:45.216",
    "end": "00:05:46.426",
    "start_seconds": 345.216,
    "end_seconds": 346.426,
    "text": "What I can do, though,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:46.467",
    "end": "00:05:49.762",
    "start_seconds": 346.467,
    "end_seconds": 349.762,
    "text": "is paint a picture of what a playful life could look like,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:49.804",
    "end": "00:05:52.056",
    "start_seconds": 349.804,
    "end_seconds": 352.056,
    "text": "because we don't need more stuff."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:52.098",
    "end": "00:05:56.269",
    "start_seconds": 352.098,
    "end_seconds": 356.269,
    "text": "We just need to start injecting it back into how we already live."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:56.561",
    "end": "00:05:59.731",
    "start_seconds": 356.561,
    "end_seconds": 359.731,
    "text": "And the three places to start are during work,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:59.772",
    "end": "00:06:02.942",
    "start_seconds": 359.772,
    "end_seconds": 362.942,
    "text": "before sleep, and in public."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:03.693",
    "end": "00:06:07.071",
    "start_seconds": 363.693,
    "end_seconds": 367.071,
    "text": "Let's start at work because most of us get stuck in this linear,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:07.113",
    "end": "00:06:08.406",
    "start_seconds": 367.113,
    "end_seconds": 368.406,
    "text": "task-oriented thinking,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:08.406",
    "end": "00:06:11.409",
    "start_seconds": 368.406,
    "end_seconds": 371.409,
    "text": "churning through to do's and in back-to-back meetings."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:11.451",
    "end": "00:06:14.120",
    "start_seconds": 371.451,
    "end_seconds": 374.12,
    "text": "But neuroscientists have found that the spontaneous,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:14.120",
    "end": "00:06:17.540",
    "start_seconds": 374.12,
    "end_seconds": 377.54,
    "text": "imaginative thinking that's underneath creative play"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:17.582",
    "end": "00:06:19.459",
    "start_seconds": 377.582,
    "end_seconds": 379.459,
    "text": "lives in a different part of our brain,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:19.459",
    "end": "00:06:21.336",
    "start_seconds": 379.459,
    "end_seconds": 381.336,
    "text": "called the default mode network."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:21.336",
    "end": "00:06:22.670",
    "start_seconds": 381.336,
    "end_seconds": 382.67,
    "text": "And that gets activated"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:22.670",
    "end": "00:06:25.924",
    "start_seconds": 382.67,
    "end_seconds": 385.924,
    "text": "when we do things we don't normally consider productive."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:26.299",
    "end": "00:06:28.676",
    "start_seconds": 386.299,
    "end_seconds": 388.676,
    "text": "Playful people mind wander."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:28.718",
    "end": "00:06:30.136",
    "start_seconds": 388.718,
    "end_seconds": 390.136,
    "text": "They daydream."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:30.178",
    "end": "00:06:33.264",
    "start_seconds": 390.178,
    "end_seconds": 393.264,
    "text": "We often call that laziness, but underneath the surface,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:33.264",
    "end": "00:06:35.934",
    "start_seconds": 393.264,
    "end_seconds": 395.93399999999997,
    "text": "our creative brain is actually hard at work,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:35.975",
    "end": "00:06:39.520",
    "start_seconds": 395.975,
    "end_seconds": 399.52,
    "text": "connecting all these disparate ideas that don't make sense yet."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:39.562",
    "end": "00:06:41.356",
    "start_seconds": 399.562,
    "end_seconds": 401.356,
    "text": "Even Einstein swore by this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:41.397",
    "end": "00:06:45.944",
    "start_seconds": 401.397,
    "end_seconds": 405.944,
    "text": "He credited his most innovative ideas not to doing math behind a desk,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:45.944",
    "end": "00:06:48.363",
    "start_seconds": 405.944,
    "end_seconds": 408.363,
    "text": "but to thought experiments."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:48.404",
    "end": "00:06:51.366",
    "start_seconds": 408.404,
    "end_seconds": 411.366,
    "text": "And right now, protecting our nonlinear thinking"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:51.407",
    "end": "00:06:53.409",
    "start_seconds": 411.407,
    "end_seconds": 413.409,
    "text": "matters more than ever."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:53.409",
    "end": "00:06:56.496",
    "start_seconds": 413.409,
    "end_seconds": 416.496,
    "text": "And that doesn't happen through doing cringey icebreakers."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:56.496",
    "end": "00:07:00.250",
    "start_seconds": 416.496,
    "end_seconds": 420.25,
    "text": "So next time you see Mark staring off into the distance during a meeting,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:00.250",
    "end": "00:07:03.002",
    "start_seconds": 420.25,
    "end_seconds": 423.002,
    "text": "or even you want to look away from your inbox,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:03.002",
    "end": "00:07:06.756",
    "start_seconds": 423.002,
    "end_seconds": 426.756,
    "text": "celebrate it because your thinking is starting to play."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:07.465",
    "end": "00:07:09.342",
    "start_seconds": 427.465,
    "end_seconds": 429.342,
    "text": "OK, that sounds doable, right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:09.384",
    "end": "00:07:12.303",
    "start_seconds": 429.384,
    "end_seconds": 432.303,
    "text": "But what happens when we get home from work?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:12.637",
    "end": "00:07:16.140",
    "start_seconds": 432.637,
    "end_seconds": 436.14,
    "text": "Well, most of us feel exhausted, so we reach for ease."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:16.182",
    "end": "00:07:18.810",
    "start_seconds": 436.182,
    "end_seconds": 438.81,
    "text": "We scroll [and] order food at the click of a button."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:18.810",
    "end": "00:07:21.479",
    "start_seconds": 438.81,
    "end_seconds": 441.479,
    "text": "We want our lives to be frictionless."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:21.479",
    "end": "00:07:25.483",
    "start_seconds": 441.479,
    "end_seconds": 445.483,
    "text": "But our play and our lives need friction."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:25.858",
    "end": "00:07:28.903",
    "start_seconds": 445.858,
    "end_seconds": 448.903,
    "text": "There's actually a type of positive stress called eustress"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:28.945",
    "end": "00:07:32.865",
    "start_seconds": 448.945,
    "end_seconds": 452.865,
    "text": "that comes about when we do things that require effort from us."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:32.865",
    "end": "00:07:34.575",
    "start_seconds": 452.865,
    "end_seconds": 454.575,
    "text": "That's why physically playing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:34.575",
    "end": "00:07:36.703",
    "start_seconds": 454.575,
    "end_seconds": 456.703,
    "text": "or making things with our bodies"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:36.744",
    "end": "00:07:38.788",
    "start_seconds": 456.744,
    "end_seconds": 458.788,
    "text": "actually expands our energy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:38.830",
    "end": "00:07:40.873",
    "start_seconds": 458.83,
    "end_seconds": 460.873,
    "text": "and even our perception of time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:41.416",
    "end": "00:07:44.419",
    "start_seconds": 461.416,
    "end_seconds": 464.419,
    "text": "But we've come to engineer the friction out of that too, though."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:44.419",
    "end": "00:07:45.586",
    "start_seconds": 464.419,
    "end_seconds": 465.586,
    "text": "We think playing at home"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:45.628",
    "end": "00:07:48.339",
    "start_seconds": 465.628,
    "end_seconds": 468.339,
    "text": "is perfectly completing a page of that adult coloring book"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:48.381",
    "end": "00:07:50.883",
    "start_seconds": 468.381,
    "end_seconds": 470.883,
    "text": "or following a YouTube tutorial to a tee."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:51.301",
    "end": "00:07:56.306",
    "start_seconds": 471.301,
    "end_seconds": 476.306,
    "text": "Real play, though, is freer than that, which can feel uncomfortable at first."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:56.347",
    "end": "00:08:00.310",
    "start_seconds": 476.347,
    "end_seconds": 480.31,
    "text": "It's experimenting with a bunch of different ingredients without a recipe"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:00.351",
    "end": "00:08:03.146",
    "start_seconds": 480.351,
    "end_seconds": 483.146,
    "text": "or doodling in the margins of your notebook."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:03.187",
    "end": "00:08:04.689",
    "start_seconds": 483.187,
    "end_seconds": 484.689,
    "text": "It can be that simple."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:04.731",
    "end": "00:08:06.649",
    "start_seconds": 484.731,
    "end_seconds": 486.649,
    "text": "That's actually exactly what I was doing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:06.691",
    "end": "00:08:09.193",
    "start_seconds": 486.691,
    "end_seconds": 489.193,
    "text": "when I had my own creative breakthrough."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:09.235",
    "end": "00:08:12.113",
    "start_seconds": 489.235,
    "end_seconds": 492.113,
    "text": "Normally, I'd get home from work and try to \"relax,\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:12.155",
    "end": "00:08:14.782",
    "start_seconds": 492.155,
    "end_seconds": 494.782,
    "text": "or if I was feeling extra adventurous,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:14.824",
    "end": "00:08:18.202",
    "start_seconds": 494.824,
    "end_seconds": 498.202,
    "text": "I'd take out my notebook and try to write something profound,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:18.244",
    "end": "00:08:20.288",
    "start_seconds": 498.244,
    "end_seconds": 500.288,
    "text": "neither of which are very playful."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:20.747",
    "end": "00:08:25.460",
    "start_seconds": 500.747,
    "end_seconds": 505.46,
    "text": "But one night while I was writing, my pen moved to the left,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:25.460",
    "end": "00:08:26.961",
    "start_seconds": 505.46,
    "end_seconds": 506.961,
    "text": "and then it made a circle."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:27.295",
    "end": "00:08:30.798",
    "start_seconds": 507.295,
    "end_seconds": 510.798,
    "text": "And then a bunch of random shapes and patterns started to flow,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:30.798",
    "end": "00:08:35.845",
    "start_seconds": 510.798,
    "end_seconds": 515.845,
    "text": "and while I did feel uncomfortable, I was also incredibly liberated."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:36.429",
    "end": "00:08:40.016",
    "start_seconds": 516.429,
    "end_seconds": 520.016,
    "text": "And when I came back to reality and tried to make sense of it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:40.058",
    "end": "00:08:44.145",
    "start_seconds": 520.058,
    "end_seconds": 524.145,
    "text": "I thought of my eight-year-old self, sitting on the floor of her room,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:44.187",
    "end": "00:08:46.397",
    "start_seconds": 524.187,
    "end_seconds": 526.397,
    "text": "waiting for something worthy to make."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:46.898",
    "end": "00:08:50.777",
    "start_seconds": 526.898,
    "end_seconds": 530.777,
    "text": "And I realized in that moment that she, like so many of us,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:50.818",
    "end": "00:08:51.986",
    "start_seconds": 530.818,
    "end_seconds": 531.986,
    "text": "got it backwards"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:51.986",
    "end": "00:08:55.907",
    "start_seconds": 531.986,
    "end_seconds": 535.907,
    "text": "because we don't need to wait for play to feel good to do it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:56.282",
    "end": "00:09:01.412",
    "start_seconds": 536.282,
    "end_seconds": 541.412,
    "text": "Doing it in the face of resistance and discomfort is how we begin."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:02.372",
    "end": "00:09:05.750",
    "start_seconds": 542.372,
    "end_seconds": 545.75,
    "text": "But we can't just play alone at our desks or in our rooms."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:05.792",
    "end": "00:09:08.252",
    "start_seconds": 545.792,
    "end_seconds": 548.252,
    "text": "We need to play in public, too."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:08.711",
    "end": "00:09:13.007",
    "start_seconds": 548.711,
    "end_seconds": 553.007,
    "text": "The last and most insidious sign of play deprivation is cultural."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:13.007",
    "end": "00:09:15.635",
    "start_seconds": 553.007,
    "end_seconds": 555.635,
    "text": "It's when we don't just deprioritize it ourselves,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:15.676",
    "end": "00:09:18.179",
    "start_seconds": 555.676,
    "end_seconds": 558.179,
    "text": "but we actively punish it in the world,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:18.221",
    "end": "00:09:21.766",
    "start_seconds": 558.221,
    "end_seconds": 561.766,
    "text": "silencing music in our parks or calling leisure time lazy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:22.183",
    "end": "00:09:23.810",
    "start_seconds": 562.183,
    "end_seconds": 563.81,
    "text": "Almost a hundred years ago,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:23.810",
    "end": "00:09:26.813",
    "start_seconds": 563.81,
    "end_seconds": 566.813,
    "text": "philosopher Johan Huizinga warned us about this,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:26.813",
    "end": "00:09:29.649",
    "start_seconds": 566.813,
    "end_seconds": 569.649,
    "text": "suggesting that when a culture loses play,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:29.649",
    "end": "00:09:32.151",
    "start_seconds": 569.649,
    "end_seconds": 572.151,
    "text": "it can become brittle and polarized,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:32.193",
    "end": "00:09:33.945",
    "start_seconds": 572.193,
    "end_seconds": 573.945,
    "text": "unable to cope with change."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:34.529",
    "end": "00:09:37.657",
    "start_seconds": 574.529,
    "end_seconds": 577.657,
    "text": "I know that might seem familiar and maybe even scary,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:37.698",
    "end": "00:09:41.077",
    "start_seconds": 577.698,
    "end_seconds": 581.077,
    "text": "but know that play is inherently contagious."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:41.411",
    "end": "00:09:42.662",
    "start_seconds": 581.4110000000001,
    "end_seconds": 582.662,
    "text": "Research actually shows"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:42.703",
    "end": "00:09:45.289",
    "start_seconds": 582.703,
    "end_seconds": 585.289,
    "text": "that just being in proximity to people doing it"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:45.331",
    "end": "00:09:47.625",
    "start_seconds": 585.331,
    "end_seconds": 587.625,
    "text": "can motivate us to do it, too."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:47.667",
    "end": "00:09:50.920",
    "start_seconds": 587.667,
    "end_seconds": 590.92,
    "text": "So we don't always need to be the main character."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:50.962",
    "end": "00:09:53.714",
    "start_seconds": 590.962,
    "end_seconds": 593.7139999999999,
    "text": "We can just amplify it when we see it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:54.048",
    "end": "00:09:56.092",
    "start_seconds": 594.048,
    "end_seconds": 596.092,
    "text": "I'm sure you've noticed this happen before,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:56.134",
    "end": "00:09:59.720",
    "start_seconds": 596.134,
    "end_seconds": 599.72,
    "text": "when a crowd begins to form around a musician,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:59.720",
    "end": "00:10:02.682",
    "start_seconds": 599.72,
    "end_seconds": 602.682,
    "text": "but most of us end up racing past."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:02.682",
    "end": "00:10:03.891",
    "start_seconds": 602.682,
    "end_seconds": 603.891,
    "text": "So next time,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:03.891",
    "end": "00:10:06.853",
    "start_seconds": 603.891,
    "end_seconds": 606.853,
    "text": "I want you to take out your headphones and listen for a moment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:06.894",
    "end": "00:10:09.939",
    "start_seconds": 606.894,
    "end_seconds": 609.939,
    "text": "Maybe be the first to laugh or clap or join in."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:09.939",
    "end": "00:10:12.650",
    "start_seconds": 609.939,
    "end_seconds": 612.65,
    "text": "Because when we make play visible,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:12.650",
    "end": "00:10:15.987",
    "start_seconds": 612.65,
    "end_seconds": 615.987,
    "text": "it allows our communities to come alive too."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:16.696",
    "end": "00:10:19.407",
    "start_seconds": 616.696,
    "end_seconds": 619.407,
    "text": "I know that even these small moments of play"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:19.407",
    "end": "00:10:21.534",
    "start_seconds": 619.407,
    "end_seconds": 621.534,
    "text": "can feel like an act of rebellion"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:21.576",
    "end": "00:10:26.289",
    "start_seconds": 621.576,
    "end_seconds": 626.289,
    "text": "in a world that's convinced us doing it as adults is unnecessary,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:26.289",
    "end": "00:10:27.999",
    "start_seconds": 626.289,
    "end_seconds": 627.999,
    "text": "and oftentimes they are."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:28.624",
    "end": "00:10:30.751",
    "start_seconds": 628.624,
    "end_seconds": 630.751,
    "text": "But it wasn't always this way."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:31.377",
    "end": "00:10:33.296",
    "start_seconds": 631.377,
    "end_seconds": 633.296,
    "text": "Since the beginning of our species,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:33.337",
    "end": "00:10:36.215",
    "start_seconds": 633.337,
    "end_seconds": 636.215,
    "text": "we have been making these beautiful, weird,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:36.257",
    "end": "00:10:40.178",
    "start_seconds": 636.257,
    "end_seconds": 640.178,
    "text": "funny, interesting things for no bigger purpose at all."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:40.511",
    "end": "00:10:44.932",
    "start_seconds": 640.511,
    "end_seconds": 644.932,
    "text": "Anthropologist Ellen Dissanayake actually has a name for this capacity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:44.974",
    "end": "00:10:47.518",
    "start_seconds": 644.974,
    "end_seconds": 647.518,
    "text": "She calls it “making special.”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:47.935",
    "end": "00:10:50.730",
    "start_seconds": 647.935,
    "end_seconds": 650.73,
    "text": "In her work studying early human societies,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:50.730",
    "end": "00:10:53.483",
    "start_seconds": 650.73,
    "end_seconds": 653.483,
    "text": "she also kept noticing an interesting pattern."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:53.983",
    "end": "00:10:57.111",
    "start_seconds": 653.983,
    "end_seconds": 657.111,
    "text": "Every culture, without having spoken to one another first,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:57.153",
    "end": "00:10:59.447",
    "start_seconds": 657.153,
    "end_seconds": 659.447,
    "text": "kept adding these playful touches"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:59.489",
    "end": "00:11:01.908",
    "start_seconds": 659.489,
    "end_seconds": 661.908,
    "text": "to the most ordinary aspects of their lives."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:02.325",
    "end": "00:11:04.994",
    "start_seconds": 662.325,
    "end_seconds": 664.994,
    "text": "They decorated their tools with intricacy,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:04.994",
    "end": "00:11:08.456",
    "start_seconds": 664.994,
    "end_seconds": 668.456,
    "text": "they made clothes and filled them with beads and shells,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:08.456",
    "end": "00:11:11.959",
    "start_seconds": 668.456,
    "end_seconds": 671.959,
    "text": "they danced and told stories and appreciated beauty"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:12.001",
    "end": "00:11:15.630",
    "start_seconds": 672.001,
    "end_seconds": 675.63,
    "text": "for no functional or productive reason."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:16.047",
    "end": "00:11:17.548",
    "start_seconds": 676.047,
    "end_seconds": 677.548,
    "text": "Just because."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:17.965",
    "end": "00:11:20.092",
    "start_seconds": 677.965,
    "end_seconds": 680.092,
    "text": "So this exact capacity,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:20.134",
    "end": "00:11:22.470",
    "start_seconds": 680.134,
    "end_seconds": 682.47,
    "text": "to play, to “make special,”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:22.512",
    "end": "00:11:24.514",
    "start_seconds": 682.512,
    "end_seconds": 684.514,
    "text": "isn’t just inside of you --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:24.805",
    "end": "00:11:28.184",
    "start_seconds": 684.805,
    "end_seconds": 688.184,
    "text": "it’s wired into our entire species."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:28.226",
    "end": "00:11:30.978",
    "start_seconds": 688.226,
    "end_seconds": 690.978,
    "text": "It's always how we've stayed human,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:31.020",
    "end": "00:11:32.855",
    "start_seconds": 691.02,
    "end_seconds": 692.855,
    "text": "how we've bonded and adapted"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:32.897",
    "end": "00:11:36.192",
    "start_seconds": 692.897,
    "end_seconds": 696.192,
    "text": "and even made meaning in life's most difficult moments."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:36.609",
    "end": "00:11:41.739",
    "start_seconds": 696.609,
    "end_seconds": 701.739,
    "text": "And I see that as our responsibility to keep that part of ourselves alive."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:42.198",
    "end": "00:11:48.246",
    "start_seconds": 702.198,
    "end_seconds": 708.246,
    "text": "So we need to play again in any form, in every part of life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:48.579",
    "end": "00:11:51.958",
    "start_seconds": 708.579,
    "end_seconds": 711.958,
    "text": "Not necessarily because it will lead us somewhere better,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:51.958",
    "end": "00:11:55.002",
    "start_seconds": 711.958,
    "end_seconds": 715.002,
    "text": "but because we are human"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:55.044",
    "end": "00:11:56.963",
    "start_seconds": 715.044,
    "end_seconds": 716.963,
    "text": "and humans play."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:57.463",
    "end": "00:11:58.589",
    "start_seconds": 717.463,
    "end_seconds": 718.5889999999999,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:58.631",
    "end": "00:12:01.092",
    "start_seconds": 718.631,
    "end_seconds": 721.092,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  }
]
